            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present application relates to an apparatus (400) for a scanning probe microscope, said apparatus having: (a) at least one first measuring probe (415, 1000) having at least one first cantilever (410, 610, 1210, 1410, 1710, 1760, 1810), the free end of which has a first measuring tip (150); (b) at least one first reflective area (420) arranged in the region of the free end (140) of the at least one first cantilever (410, 610, 1210, 1410, 1710, 1760, 1810) and embodied to reflect at least two light beams (440, 450, 460, 1240, 1250, 1260, 1440, 1450, 1460) in different directions; and (c) at least two first interferometers (475, 480, 485) embodied to use the at least two light beams (445, 455, 465) reflected by the at least one first reflective area to determine the position of the first measuring tip (150).</p>
            </abstract>
